OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FGales easing
OL,6,Fbut remaining windy overnight,
OL,7,Fespecially across the Outer Hebrides.
OL,8,FCloudy with rain, heavy at times,
OL,9,Fspreading southeastwards. Turning
OL,10,Fdrier overnight with clear spells and
OL,11,Fshowers in northwest.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FSome bright or sunny spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping during the day but these
OL,15,Finterspersed with cloudier conditions
OL,16,Fand showers, which may be heavy. Still
OL,17,Fbreezy but winds generally easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
